  "title": "Bacon-Cheddar Potato Skins",
  "description": "The bacon-Cheddar potato skins are baked until crispy, then topped with sour cream and green onions for a super simple snack, appetizer, or main meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Joshua Olson"
  ],
